{"updated":"2026-10-29T19:04:45.006Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Texas Republican group seeks to block certification of state’s election. Elsewhere, US Muslims concerned but resilient as ‘hate’ attacks target Abdul El-Sayed. And finland launches criminal probe of suspected environmental damage by Google. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 0.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.7 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 2.5 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 40 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.4 near southeast of Easter Island. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.34,0.38,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.82,0.92,1.09,1.47,1.6,1.65,1.67,1.7,1.74,1.76,1.79,1.81,1.86,1.9,1.99,2.04,2.09,2.13,2.16,2.21,2.24,2.26,2.32,2.37,2.4,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.58,2.62,2.67,2.73,2.79,2.86,2.97,3.09,3.24,3.27,3.31,3.34,3.39,3.44,3.5,3.59,3.67,3.73,3.79,3.83,3.88,3.92,3.97,4.02,4.04,4.06,4.11,4.13,4.16,4.18,4.23,4.27,4.37,4.42,4.49,4.56,4.63,4.72,4.76,4.82,4.84,4.9,5.02,5.17,5.34,5.85,5.93,6.03,6.14,6.24,6.27,6.34,6.37,6.44,6.5,6.55,6.61,6.65,6.7,6.75,6.82,6.86,6.93,6.98,7.02,7.07,7.12,7.19,7.28,7.35,7.42,7.46,7.51,7.56,7.61,7.63,7.66,7.73,7.78,7.84,7.88,7.93,7.96,8.02,8.06,8.12,8.16,8.21,8.27,8.32,8.39,8.46,8.58,8.64,8.68,8.73,8.78,8.82,8.85,8.88,8.94,8.99,9.06,9.14,9.18,9.22,9.24,9.27,9.31,9.37,9.44,9.51,9.57,9.63,9.67,9.72,9.81,9.96,10.4,10.52,10.58,10.63,10.68,10.73,10.8,10.83,10.89,11.04,11.09,11.17,11.34,11.49,11.57,11.61,11.69,11.76,11.82,11.89,11.95,11.99,12.05,12.09,12.13,12.21,12.29,12.39,12.45,12.49,12.53,12.55,12.6,12.63,12.68,12.7,12.76,12.79,12.85,12.92,12.99,13.05,13.1,13.14,1